{"ref":"BDB, כָּבוֹד","hw":"כָּבוֹד","html":"† I. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">כָּבוֹד</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. glorious</strong>, only fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּבוּדָּ֯ה</span>, of a bed <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:41\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.41\">Ez 23:41</a>; a queen in bridal array <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:14\" href=\"/Psalms.45.14\">ψ 45:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:14\" href=\"/Psalms.45.14\">ψ 45:14</a> belongs to II. <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּבוֹד</span> <strong>2</strong>; cstr. as Ges<sup>§ 141 d</sup>; v. also <span dir=\"rtl\">כֹּל</span> <strong>1 a</strong> end. cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, כְּבוּדָּ֯ה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_כְּבוּדָּ֯ה\">כְּבוּדָּ֯ה</a> <strong>n.f.</strong> infr.","next":"BDB, כָּבוֹד²","prev":"BDB, כֹּ֫בֶד"}